00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:07.740
The Fed can also be reactionary.

00:09:08.220 --> 00:09:10.580
And it's just knowledge that we must have.

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:18.880
We need to know at any one moment in time,
as traders and PMs, what is actually
happening with inflation in the economy.

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:25.680
So, that's how inflation is measured in
